    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last remaining SpellBinder in this kingdom, learn how to combine Blue, Pink and Green spells into one powerful entity to protect everyone from dark magic. Runs are quick and satisfying, choose a way to upgrade your current spells, explore new ones, exploit broken combos and get as far as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay loop is simple, you have 3 encounters to customize and upgrade your Spell. Next step is combining spells and dealing enough damage! The levels are currently infinite and the damage required scales exponentially, so try to keep up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is the option to save good runs and replay a deck in infinite mode, for when you hit that nasty combo that you just can't get enough of.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last remaining SpellBinder in this kingdom, learn how to combine Blue, Pink and Green spells into one powerful entity to protect everyone from dark magic. Runs are quick and satisfying, choose a way to upgrade your current spells, explore new ones, exploit broken combos and get as far as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay loop is simple, you have 3 encounters to customize and upgrade your Spell. Next step is combining spells and dealing enough damage! The levels are currently infinite and the damage required scales exponentially, so try to keep up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is the option to save good runs and replay a deck in infinite mode, for when you hit that nasty combo that you just can't get enough of.</p>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced strategy deckbuilder. You're a spellbinder combining all sorts of different magic into one powerful spell, but can you scale it enough to keep going? Made for those quick and satisfying dopamine hits!",
